 wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Red_augments\" title=\"Category:Red augments\">Red</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Antipode,_Fist_of_the_Horizon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Antipode%2C_Fist_of_the_Horizon.png/420px-Antipode%2C_Fist_of_the_Horizon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"673\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Antipode%2C_Fist_of_the_Horizon.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Attuned_to_Heroism\" title=\"Attuned to Heroism\">Attuned to Heroism</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>Spun from enchanted golden thread, this cloth was created to harness and contain planer energies. When wrapped around ones hands, their unarmed attacks can unleash those energies to devastating effect.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>This weapon is the best way to determine a monster's <a href=\"/page/Alignment\" title=\"Alignment\">alignment</a>. For instance, if the target takes Chaotic and Good damage, it must be Lawful Evil; but if it takes Evil, Good, and Lawful damage, it's Chaotic Neutral.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816221437\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.113 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.181 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5428/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47155/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14705/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 2/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  154.125      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  154.125      1 -total\n 97.39%  150.107      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 91.10%  140.401     71 Template:IO\n 31.56%   48.646      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 31.02%   47.808      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 28.67%   44.181      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 27.43%   42.273      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.29%   35.891     13 Template:Popup\n 18.37%   28.308      1 Template:Attuned_to_Heroism\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:26555-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816221437 and revision id 672325. Re